OL,3,GNEWSAReform's Joe Martin given Senedd
OL,4,Aspeaking ban after he said white people
OL,5,Aare being replaced
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Reform Member of the Senedd (MS) has
OL,8,Fbeen banned from speaking in the Welsh
OL,9,FParliament until he apologises for
OL,10,Fclaiming white people were being
OL,11,Freplaced in the UK.
OL,13,FPresiding Officer Huw Irranca-Davies
OL,14,Fsaid Joe Martin's comments were clearly
OL,15,F"discriminatory" and "offensive".
OL,17,FOn Tuesday Martin asked the Welsh
OL,18,Fgovernment for a statement on the
OL,19,F"demographic replacement of white
OL,20,FBritish people".
OL,22,FReform was asked for comment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
